OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWe've followed their lives for six
OL,4,Adecades - now the stars of 7 Up are
OL,5,Abowing out
OL,6,
OL,7,FSix decades have passed since Jackie
OL,8,FBassett first appeared on TV aged
OL,9,Fseven, skipping down the road with her
OL,10,Flittle sister.
OL,12,FIt was 1964 and she had been selected
OL,13,Fby teachers at her east London primary
OL,14,Fschool to appear in a documentary
OL,15,Fcalled 7 Up.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789220900
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWe've followed their lives for six
OL,4,Adecades - now the stars of 7 Up are
OL,5,Abowing out
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe show interviewed 14 seven-year-olds
OL,8,Ffrom vastly different socioeconomic
OL,9,Fbackgrounds. Inspired by the Jesuit
OL,10,Fsaying: "Give me the child until he is
OL,11,Fseven and I will show you the man", it
OL,12,Fwas intended as a one-off - a snapshot
OL,13,Fof Britain's class system and how it
OL,14,Fshapes us from a young age.
OL,16,F"They only picked me because I never
OL,17,Fstopped talking," Jackie told the BBC,
OL,18,Fwith an infectious giggle that hasn't
OL,19,Fchanged since childhood.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
